{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>37歲崔碧珈早前捲入與58歲鄭健樂相差21載父女戀風波，近日她作客節目《九運會客室2》時終於打破沉默公開事件始末。原來當初一張單純協助宣傳健身事業合照竟被對方利用作炒作工具，更私下聯絡媒體編造戀愛故事。面對對方屢勸不改並多次重施故技，女方最終決定採取極端手段徹底斬纜。崔碧珈作客《九運會客室2》還原合照風波真...</p>\n<p>37歲崔碧珈早前捲入與58歲鄭健樂相差21載父女戀風波，近日她作客節目《九運會客室2》時終於打破沉默公開事件始末。原來當初一張單純協助宣傳健身事業合照竟被對方利用作炒作工具，更私下聯絡媒體編造戀愛故事。面對對方屢勸不改並多次重施故技，女方最終決定採取極端手段徹底斬纜。</p>\n<h2>崔碧珈作客《九運會客室2》還原合照風波真相</h2>\n<p>崔碧珈接受伍詠薇與Brian主持訪問時重提這段緋聞，她重申當初答應合照純粹是出於同行互助心態，應男方要求協助宣傳健身事業。怎料這份善意最終被借題發揮，她直言比起委屈更多是感到憤怒，並在節目中大爆內幕指「佢就利用呢張相去做其他故仔」。她強調對方從未私下聯絡交代，反而直接找媒體講述自己編造版本，令這場相差21歲緋聞瞬間變成單方面炒作鬧劇。</p>\n<h2>女方透過公司發律師信並報警備案劃清界線</h2>\n<p>發現被利用後崔碧珈曾多次透過訊息私下交涉，她坦言當時情緒激動並發出嚴厲警告，直指「好難聽嘅說話都有喺Message白紙黑字講晒㗎喇」。然而男方依然故我未有停止炒作行為，由於私下無法解決爭端，崔碧珈最終決定透過所屬公司發出律師信。為了進一步保護自己，她更前往警署完成報案程序，以法律途徑強硬應對這場無妄之災。</p>\n<h2>鄭健樂分段式炒作緋聞令當事人對拍拖留陰影</h2>\n<p>這場風波並非單一事件，崔碧珈進一步透露對方在不同月份分開幾次反覆提及緋聞，每當她情緒稍為平復又會掀起新一波炒作。被問到日常接觸中是否不自覺給予對方錯誤信號時，她斷然否認並強調自己性格獨立猶如男人，私下外出總是戴大帽遮面及保持素顏。她堅稱自己向來公私分明，絕對不可能給予對方任何拍拖錯覺，並坦言這次事件令她對日後發展新戀情留下極大陰影。</p>\n<h2>網民湧入社交平台留言攻擊引發兩極化爭議</h2>\n<p>隨著男方反覆高調提及這段虛構關係，大量網民信以為真並湧入女方社交平台留言指責，令她無端遭受猛烈網絡圍剿。有網民留言表示「心痛Rocky哥1秒」，亦有人質疑女方處理手法過於直接。不過當真相逐漸浮出水面後，風向開始出現轉變，不少人認為男方行為構成滋擾，並留言支持女方採取法律行動保護自己。雙方事件最終透過法律程序告一段落，女方社交平台逐漸回復平靜。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344868948964116_11489588716ae5daf206ea3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"談及與Rocky傳出的緋聞。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344868948964116_11489588716ae5daf206ea3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>37歲崔碧珈上節目談及與Rocky傳出的緋聞。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344869179768334_15019233476ae5daf410668.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rocky反覆提及緋聞。(節目截圖)\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344869179768334_15019233476ae5daf410668.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Rocky反覆提及緋聞。（圖片來源：《女神配對計劃2》節目截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/17657719197431940_360773233693f8a9026d9a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈 鄭健樂 （圖片來源：fb@Anita Chui）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/17657719197431940_360773233693f8a9026d9a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：fb@Anita Chui）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176577191670720298_1727582518693f8a8dd89ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈 鄭健樂 「大隻Rocky」單方面公開與崔碧珈戀愛關係（圖片來源：FB@Rocky Cheng ）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176577191670720298_1727582518693f8a8dd89ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「大隻Rocky」單方面公開與崔碧珈戀愛關係（圖片來源：FB@Rocky Cheng ）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176587348374835201_4899549296941174be0823.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄭健樂 崔碧珈 明顯是在暗指Rocky的一廂情願行為（圖片來源：IG@Anita Chui）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176587348374835201_4899549296941174be0823.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>明顯是在暗指Rocky的一廂情願行為（圖片來源：IG@Anita Chui）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344869381350435_11851259566ae5daf65328c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈透過所屬公司高影娛樂於Threads上發布嚴正聲明。(Threads圖片)\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344869381350435_11851259566ae5daf65328c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>崔碧珈於Threads上發布嚴正聲明。（圖片來源：Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17895307710305309_19445992196aaa129367fde.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈 鄭健樂 （圖片來源：fb@Anita Chui）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17895307710305309_19445992196aaa129367fde.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：fb@Anita Chui）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178305500086812767_2986564676a47429953e8f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈 鄭健樂 （圖片來源：IG@anitachui）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178305500086812767_2986564676a47429953e8f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@anitachui）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/177581509784777940_19594194369d8c9b9f1658.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈 鄭健樂 （圖片來源：fb@崔碧珈 Anita Chui）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/177581509784777940_19594194369d8c9b9f1658.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：fb@崔碧珈 Anita Chui）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/177545995599595471_104326116469d35e746037c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"崔碧珈 鄭健樂 （圖片來源：IG@anitachui）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/177545995599595471_104326116469d35e746037c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@anitachui）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:04.996408+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1547,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T01:10:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:56.367238+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:56.367238+00:00","content_hash":"e49fcbe1ac9a6851fb91cc68ea5727144d7452cd0e1856ed87bfc6ccaeae0277","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}